sequenceDiagram
    participant Compliance as SVC-015<br/>Compliance Core
    participant KYC as SVC-014<br/>KYC/AML
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant CommBank as SVC-005<br/>Commercial Banking Core
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging
    actor CompOfficer as PER-052<br/>Compliance Officer

    Note over Compliance,Audit: EX-001 — Sanctions Hit During CDD Screening

    KYC->>KYC: Sanctions screening returns OFSI hit on UBO
    KYC-->>Compliance: sanctions_hit=true, sanctions_list=OFSI (intra-capability)
    Compliance->>EventBus: Publish CddSanctionsHitDetected (EVT-144) {hit_entity, sanctions_list: OFSI}
    EventBus->>CommBank: Consume EVT-144 → Suspend client account pending MLRO review
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-144 → Write WORM audit record (OFSI compliance — GOV-005-R02)
    Compliance-->>CompOfficer: IMMEDIATE ALERT: OFSI sanctions hit — MLRO action required within 14 days
    CompOfficer->>Compliance: Initiate OFSI notification + relationship exit decision (POST /cdd-reviews/{id}/decision)
    Compliance->>EventBus: Publish CddExitEscalated (EVT-147) {exit_reason: sanctions_hit, senior_manager_approval_id}
    EventBus->>CommBank: Consume EVT-147 → Initiate client offboarding workflow
